2. Any of the following large-scale development projects: Where an application for approval, authorization, permission, etc. of an implementation plan, etc. is filed for the first time after this Decree enters into force:
a. A housing construction project and a housing site preparation project under the Housing Act;
b. Amusement park installation project under the National Land Planning and Utilization Act;
c. Hot springs development projects under the Hot Spring Act;
d. Park projects under the Natural Parks Act;
